      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SHADE OF PALE (1) has been in super consistent form recently with two minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing fourth (38.05) at Bendigo. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Key runner on his best form. BLUE MOON MARIE (4) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 4 lengths at Mt Gambier in a handy 34.83 beating Aston Sushi. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. In top form and looks a key chance again. BINDY BLAZER (5) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Reiko Comet (25.79) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Can measure up. BIG BOY JETT (8) is a last start winner who rates one of the chances again.",
